<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>⚠️ Demo XSS</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-red-50 min-h-screen">
  <div class="bg-red-600 text-white text-center text-sm font-semibold py-2 px-4">
    ⚠️ HALAMAN INI SENGAJA RENTAN XSS, buat demo materi. JANGAN dipake di production.
  </div>
  <%- include('../partials/demo-nav', { title: '5. XSS (Cross-Site Scripting)' }) %>

  <main class="max-w-xl mx-auto px-4 pb-10">
    <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 text-blue-800 text-sm rounded-lg px-4 py-3 mb-6">
      <p class="mb-2"><strong>Reflected XSS</strong> — coba payload ini di kotak bawah:</p>
      <code class="block bg-white/60 rounded p-2 mb-2 text-xs break-all">&lt;script&gt;alert('XSS dari ' + document.cookie)&lt;/script&gt;</code>
      <p class="text-xs">
        Kalo beneran nge-alert, itu artinya script asing bisa baca <code>document.cookie</code>
        punya user — di dunia nyata, ini dipake buat nyolong session/cookie login orang lain.
      </p>
    </div>

    <form method="GET" action="/demo/xss" class="flex gap-2 mb-6">
      <input
        type="text"
        name="input"
        value="<%= input %>"
        placeholder="<script>alert('XSS')</script>"
        class="flex-1 border border-red-300 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm"
      />
      <button class="bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-700 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold">Kirim</button>
    </form>

    <% if (submitted) { %>
      <div class="bg-white border border-red-300 rounded-xl p-4 mb-6">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-600 mb-2">Hasil di-render (unescaped):</p>
        <div class="border border-dashed border-red-300 rounded p-3 text-sm">
          <%- input %>
        </div>
      </div>
    <% } %>

    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-4">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-2">Bonus: Stored XSS</p>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mb-3">
        Buka <a href="/search-unsafe-demo" class="text-blue-600 underline">/search-unsafe-demo</a>
        terus search produk apa aja (biar semua produk kekumpul) — ada 1 produk dari seeder
        yang NAMANYA sendiri isi payload <code>&lt;script&gt;</code>. Bedanya sama reflected:
        payload ini udah "nempel" di database, jadi ke-trigger ke SEMUA orang yang buka
        halaman itu, bukan cuma yang ngetik payload-nya.
      </p>
    </div>

    <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-6">
      Kode lengkap: <code>controllers/demo.unsafe.controller.js</code> (<code>xssDemo</code>) +
      <code>seeders/seed.js</code> (produk demo stored XSS).
    </p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
